      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANALYZATION (7) has a strong overall record having 22 wins and eight places from 39 starts including a last start success (28.14) over 500m at Bendigo. Has a strong record at this journey including 15 wins. Drawn wide but with a clean break will be tough to beat again. MEPUNGA ENVY (6) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on his blistering win the start prior, getting around Sandown over 515m in 29.43. Has the ability and looks a key chance. DAD'S SURPRISE (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.6 lengths at this track in a handy 26.20 beating Azzurro Wren. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. QUEST FOR STORM (2) was out of placings last time (30.56) at The Meadows in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 12 lengths. Yet to taste defeat in two runs from this draw.",
